      "created_at": "2015-04-14T19:32:25.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I don't want to keep bothering the other status update thread for this topic. My Fire currently says that it updated the game today, but the game still says it's v.1.2.3 when I boot it up, and Rook City is unavailable. When it was finished downloading, I saw it \"Install\", so I'm not sure what's going on there.</p><p>I'm trying the ol' \"uninstall and redownload everything\" trick, since that's the only thing I can find that I haven't tried yet. But if anyone else with a Kindle Fire has gotten it to work, or if anyone else has any ideas, please let me know.</p>",
      "post_number": 1,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T01:44:30.070Z",
