      "raw": "<p>I don&#39;t want to keep bothering the other status update thread for this topic. My Fire currently says that it updated the game today, but the game still says it&#39;s v.1.2.3 when I boot it up, and Rook City is unavailable. When it was finished downloading, I saw it &quot;Install&quot;, so I&#39;m not sure what&#39;s going on there.</p><p>I&#39;m trying the ol&#39; &quot;uninstall and redownload everything&quot; trick, since that&#39;s the only thing I can find that I haven&#39;t tried yet. But if anyone else with a Kindle Fire has gotten it to work, or if anyone else has any ideas, please let me know.</p>",
